Z||000022||Standard||03-18-2001||10:32 PM||||Most annoying thing people do?  Get in my way  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I'd have to agree with all the above.  Especially people that zoom up behind you and ride on your ass on a 2 lane highway when there's not another car in sight.  Or just people that zoom up behind you, period.. usually at those times a quick brake check is in order.  I try to wait until that point where they get the closest to my car before they start slowing down.. I love watching the headlights dip down and it's an extra bonus if I can see their face in the rear view  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000023||MontanaFiero||03-19-2001||01:24 AM||||How 'bout the guy who drives four or five miles with his blinker <I>on</I>. -- then turns the opposite direction. Maybe it's just us rural states.<P>Or -- the guy that drives ten miles UNDER the speed limit and <I>compensates</I> by just coasting right through the stop signs. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> That really burns me up because I'd for damned sure get a caught if I followed him right through. <P>But what am I worried about. This is Montana, mild driving compared to you all.  Where:<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>a traffic jam is having to wait through two left turn signals<BR><LI>bad traffic delays us by five to seven minutes<BR><LI>we only use the "freeway" to get the hell out of town<BR><LI>it sucks to have to wait for a train through the middle of town<BR><LI>your boss laughs histerically if you use "traffic" as your excuse for being late.<BR></UL><BR>(Billings population 100,000) ||||reg||1
Z||000024||Jake||03-19-2001||01:52 AM||||I really hate people that ride my A$$ <BR>I remember one time cruising along in my fiero doing about 5 over the limit when I look in my rear view and see a VW GTI smack dab on my A$$. I lightly hit my brake lights to maybe get the point across to him to back off but he didn't get it. So I just stepped on the brakes as hard as I could  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> He swerved in the other lane sliding. He was actually beside me at one point. That's when I hammered it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I looked back and he gave me the finger of course. Luckily I had my sunroof out so I could give him two. One out my window and one out the roof. He immidetly took the next turn with no signal. <P>----------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Rxbw.jpg"> ||||reg||12
Z||000025||hugh||03-19-2001||07:14 AM||||When I have someone on my back bumper I usually tap the brakes and they back off.If that doesn't work I hit them harder.I figure if I have to stop fast and get hit by the idiot,I'll pick the spot.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/hugh_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000026||ChadMan||03-19-2001||08:28 AM||||Two things.<P>1)  You're driving 75 down the freeway, slowly gaining on a line of cars in the right lane going 70 or so.  Over the span of a minute or so, you slowly catch up to them, then move left to pass.  When the last guy in the line of slower cars sees you, he immediately gets in the fast lane to block you, but does not speed up.  Now you're trapped, unless you want to use the berm.<P>2)  You're going 75 in the passing lane.  A faster car pulls up behind you.  You move right to let him by.  He pulls alongside, but instead of maintaining his speed and passing you, he slows down to match your speed.  You approach slower traffic.  You gun it, he guns it.  You slow down, he slows down.  Now you're trapped in the slow lane.  Thanks, a$$hole!<P>I'm a native Buckeye and I love Ohio, but I must say Ohio drivers are the worst I've encountered anywhere (except maybe Indiana).  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||8
Z||000027||rogergarrison||03-19-2001||09:42 AM||||HIGH-FIVES JAKE!!!!!!!<P>thats what Im talkin about. I usually go 10-15 mph over the limit. But no matter how fast you go theres always someone who thinks riding your bumper will make you move over. Ill keep a foot on brake pedal or pump them a bunch to give them a hint. I love it if they stay on my ass and i pull beside a semi. Ill match the semi speed for miles as long as no one is backing up behind us-really pisses them off !!! I love it.||||reg||1
Z||000028||stsmithgt||03-19-2001||11:21 AM||||How about the drivers with lousy timing?  Coming up on a vehicle in the left lane and there's lots of open room in the right lanes.  I don't like passing on the right so I give them some time to get out of the way.  I'll run it up to them and then back off.  I'll peek around to the left of them to fill their side mirror up.  Nothing works.  Others are starting to pass on the right, so I reluctantly change lanes into the right lane to go around(using my blinker) Doh!~ NOW they decide get into the right lane. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> By this time someone else is taking advantage of the open left lane. BLOCKED for now.  An uncontrollable twitch starts up in the corner of my right eye from the blood pressure reaching dangerous levels.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000029||frontal lobe||03-20-2001||12:13 AM||||I can live with almost anything people do on the road, as long as they DO IT IN THE RIGHT LANE.  I HATE left-lane hangers.<P>Also, people who won't accelerate into traffic from on-ramps and actually stop on them.  That is downright dangerous.||||reg||1
Z||000030||webbee||03-20-2001||12:57 AM||||A 70 year old, doing 45 in the passing lane, talking on the cell phone, with his blinker on, reading from a book, sliding back and forth in the lane, towing a boat, wife is yelling instructions, and there is traffic preventing you from passing.<P>People that jet around you, pile on the brakes and slowly make a right turn, you were the only car ahead of them, and doing the speed limit.<P>I could go on but...  ||||reg||1
Z||000031||Sleeper||03-20-2001||01:32 AM||||the only thing that bugs me is when i'm coming to a stop sign and another car going the other way(crossing in front on me) gets there before me and they just sit there and wait, wait, wait and wait and i'm thinking "you where there first, get the f*ck going" and then they motion you to go. i'm like whatever.<P><BR>----------------<BR>i rarely use my blinker unless there is traffic, i run red lights(late, late night), use my blinker but turn the opposite direction(just to confuse ppl), etc, etc...i just like to f*ck with ppl cuz i know its innoying...my friend used to have a real police siren we used to pull ppl over, it was pretty funny.||||reg||1
Z||000032||Ozzy||03-20-2001||01:43 AM||||Nose picking!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000033||Haze_Performance||03-20-2001||01:52 AM||||OK....I was at a red light in my 1971 Buick. It had a tow hitch & ball on it. There was this old guy (in his 70's)behind me. (mind you, we were at the light completly stopped for quite some time before the following happened) He floored the pedal on his early 80's LTD and smashed into me. My tow ball went right throught his (steel) bumper, condenser, radiator & took out his fan.<P>His reason for hitting me........... He said he thought he heard someone honk a horn at him.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">     </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery</A>||||reg||8
Z||000034||Nashco||03-20-2001||02:44 AM||||I can't stand people driving slow in the left lane...argh!  I'm from Washington, go to school in Michigan, and work in Alabama, so I've seen all kinds of traffic.  In Washington there's always traffic jams, and you get to see idiots swerve through lanes trying to get one or two car lengths ahead...like it matters.  If you're lucky enough to have two passengers, you can use the HOV lane, woohoo!  Oh, but there's somebody who likes to go 40 in a 55 in front of you and the other lanes are totally full...doh!  In Alabama I get pissed when there's a semi trying to pass another semi in a two lane freeway, and they won't actually accelerate past the other truck...just keep cruising about 1 mph faster than the slow truck.  Five minutes later, my teeny car can finally get through.  In Michigan the most annoying thing is nobody using blinkers.  Apparently the general public here thinks that was made for backward folk outside the Michigan/Ohio area.  Stupid people <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Ok, I've b*tched enough for tonight... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
Z||000035||HAGS||03-20-2001||03:08 AM||||Slow in the fast lane is the worst thing you can do to me, I also hate people that change lanes or slow down when I pull out in front of them....they actually think they are gonna have to pass me!  I love when people try to tailgate me, im a tailgater myself if your not passing in the fast lane and all other ways around you are blocked and you can move forward with no problem.  I piss alot of people off and I can see them trying to tailgate me back....they start to fall off around 120 mph.... a mustang did come up to me after I blew by him, I was doing 70 now instead of 95 and he was sitting next to me doing the exact same speed waiting for me to race....I gladly stepped on the gas and got spanked, he was pulled over less than a minute later.....why do you think I was going so slow?!?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>What makes me happy are people that see you comming up and get out of the fast lane before you get there, people that accelerate hard from stops, people that are more aggresive than me on the highway, and fast groups to follow on long trips to avoid tickets...people that move over to let you pass on slow roads even if you dont need or want to pass...<P>PS: if I people dont move over to the slow lane where they belong I usually pass them on the right and get in front of them and let it coast until they change lanes then I take off, if they get back in the left lane I slow down and wait for them....depending on traffic and their speed....I will teach america one driver at a time....my brother is in Germany with his 86 GT livin large.||||reg||1
Z||000036||fropuff||03-20-2001||08:09 PM||||Okay, I've got two from personal experience.  One was today.  I was coming from school; a train was crossing, so I took a different way.  Anyway, I was going 50 in a 30 (I know...), then there's a stop sign ahead.  I slow down, just like a normal person would do, and the kid that was tailgating me the whole way passes on the left (on a two-way street) and completely blows the stop sign.  That pissed me off, so I got right on his ass for a little while.  What a dumb sh*t.  <P>My second story; this occured last Monday.  It's about females (not all) driving fast.  Why in the hell don't they think that they're going to get a ticket?  Just 'cause they're girls, doesn't mean that the cops should let them off easier.  That said, here's the story... again, I was coming home from school, turn right off the highway.  A girl in an early-90s Oldsmobile Cutlass gets RIGHT on my ass the whole time until the highway.  We go like this for around 7 miles.  I was trying to lose this b*tch, so I passed a few cars on the shoulder and sped a little (15 over)  She was right with me the whole way.  I was going around 50 in a 40, and since she was right on my ass, I weaved a little in the lanes so she couldn't pass.  I think this made her mad; don't know why.  Anyway, we both got a green arrow to take a left onto the highway.  I take the outside (right) lane and slow down.  She takes the left lane and tries to pass me like a mo-fo.  I didn't want her to do this, so I sped up a little; so did she.  In short, I got up to 105; she was going around 95.  I try to slow her down by blocking her in with the guy in the right lane.  This didn't really work good.  I always had the lead.  My turn was coming up; I had to turn right, her left.  I did a little pissy honk at her, and the day was over. <BR>Not a very exciting story, just wanted to inform everyone on the dangers of teen girl driving.  I guess you could say the same about me, but you'd be wrong.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I haven't got a ticket in the mail yet, so I think I'm clear.  I thought she would have gotten my plate.  I just hope one isn't coming from My7Fieros.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  ||||reg||1
Z||000037||GarethWright||03-21-2001||01:33 AM||||Thing that makes me MAD!!! is people in Large SUVs or Trucks, Or Minivans turning left and pulling along side you while you are waiting to turn right (normally out of my neighborhood), you can't see anything but their passenger side door until they leave.<P>Story:<BR>About a mile from my house, a large, high-traffic street merges from 3 lanes to one in about 500 feet.  If you want to go through the intersection, you are stuck in traffic for about 15-30 mins on a busy day.  But of course, some people dont Want to wait in traffic, so they cruise down the outside lane, and get mad when I don't let them in infront of me.  Of course, if ya wanna turn Right at the intersection, you can skip it all together, theres a back-road that leads to the intersecting street.  I like to take this back road, because I can cruise down the outside lane and watch as people start to ride each others fenders so theres no room to get in, Look em all in the eye and act sad as ya go by, then hit the right turn and speed away!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <BR>Happy (or enraged, suit yourself) Motoring!<BR>Gareth.||||reg||1
Z||000038||Joe4x4||03-21-2001||08:00 AM||||1)old people....over 60<BR>2)Girls doing there face as they drive<BR>3)cell phone user`s<BR>4)exit wramp stoppers<BR>5)last min turn sig user`s<BR>6)slow people in fast lane<BR>7)people that slow down to look at a accident<BR>8)no turn signal than change lane<BR>9)HATE DRIVER`S THAT DO NOT PUT THERE KIDS<BR>IN SEAT BEALT`S,AND CAR SEAT`S<BR>10)DRUNK DRIVER`S<P>.....Biker`s....<BR>The # 1 thing that I hate is when I take my <BR>street bike out is that people do not look when changing lanes ( Almost got hit too <BR>many times to count )<BR><P>------------------<BR>Need For Speed........<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/car1.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000039||stsmithgt||03-21-2001||09:39 AM||||What is it with those Mustang drivers?  I had one this morning on the way to work I casually passed on the freeway.  He gets behind me and tailgates to get around slower traffic.  I speed up...75...80... then he passes me on the right.  When I passed him, he was going about 65.  He slows back down in the right lane until he's right next to me.  He stays there matching my speed.  After passing that one car, there isn't anyone else nearby on the road.  I'm looking over a couple times to see if he's trying to provoke something ..... nothing.... Coming up on traffic now I decided to show him he's bothering me.  I floor it and shut his door hard at about 90 and snaked my way through a couple cars that I knew would block him up.  I hate it when someone crowds me for no reason.  It's not safe. (As if the hole shot I did was)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I'll keep my eye out for that guy from now on.  He might need another lesson.<p>[This message has been edited by stsmithgt (edited 03-21-2001).]||||reg||4
