Z||000042||fropuff||03-21-2001||11:20 PM||||I sure hope to hell that none of you guys drink and drive today.  Bringing a kid home from school today, there's a red Caravan parked in an intersection; off a road turning left onto a highway.  I pass the guy; he was just sitting there.  I looked back and saw that he appeared to be sleeping.  I pulled a U-turn in the middle of the road and went back; I didn't want him to get hit.  I drove right up to his van and honked like sh*t next to his window.  He didn't even move.  I got out and knocked on the window with me fist; still nothing.  He wasn't moving, so I called 911.  They said to check for breathing, so I opened the door, and his arm fell to the floor.  I thought this guy was dead.  A few other cars pull up, as well as a nurse.  She said that he was breathing and had a pulse.  The cops and ambulance came, and everything was okay.  They arrested him; he was bombed.  His breath smelled like liquor, and there was a wine cooler bottle rolling around in the back.  So, DON'T DRINK AND DRIVE!!!||||reg||1
Z||000043||Black88GT||03-21-2001||11:34 PM||||wine cooler?||||reg||5
Z||000044||William||03-22-2001||12:41 AM||||I hate people that should DIE!!!!! Here's my little story that happened last month. I cruising home from work on I-10 and because I had a very bad day at work, I wasn't paying attention like I should have. A car was trying to merge from an on ramp, and I didn't see him until the last minute. I jerked my car into the opposite lane at the last minute as he was out of room and it was my fault. He was then able to merge in. I figured that...<P>1. He knew that I did that to let him in and..<P>2. Because I did do that, I was NOT trying keep him from merging over, and it was not deliberate, right? WRONG<P>I then put on my blinker on to change back into the slow lane because I had semi trucks barreling down on me and I was in my slow suzuki beater. So this prick see's this and slides right in beside me blocking my path.GRRRRR I then speed up to 85 MPH, and he matches me the whole way. I then slow to 45 and he's right there. back and forth this goes with the log trucks pissed and wanting me out of the way. Then this guy starts swereing at me like he's going ram the car. At this point I'm outraged. I almost flip my jeep to cut him some slack and let him merge, and now i'm a driver in a bad B movie.<BR>This goes on for 5 miles and he takes off. At this point all I want to do his follow him home and beat him to death. I try to follow him but the little jeep just can't keep up. If I every found this guy I'm really afraid of what I would do.||||reg||8
