Z||000052||fyerstarter||03-25-2001||04:41 PM||||I've noticed two of the most common complaints here are "Slow people in the fast lane who won't move" and "People who tailgate you and flash their brights as you"<P>Well here's a news flash. If people are tailgating you and flashing their brights at you, Then you are the slow guy in the fast lane! MOVE OVER!<P>I like to drive pretty fast. I live in California and if I'm doing less than 90 on the freeway I'm pretty pissed off. <P>It doesn't matter if you are in the fast lane and your doing 5 over, or 10 over, whatever. If there's someone behind you who wants to go faster just pull over and let them pass. They will be gone out of your life in 10 seconds and then you can jump right back in the fast lane.<P>Your just being an inconsiderate prick when you slow down or break check someone. Just have some common courtesy. If you don't want a ticket or if you are in no hurry them good for you, just pull one lane over temporarily and let the person behind you get on with his business.||||reg||1
