Z||000054||filthyscarecrow||03-25-2001||09:14 PM||||i hate tailgaters. know what stops them? throw the car back and forth a couple times at high speed like you're warming up the tires. they think you're F###ING crazy adn they back the hell off. i have had a 100% success rate with this technique. <BR>and being a driving instructor part time, teaching the kiddies how not to drive like the majority of other morons out there, i see my fair share of them. i have seen no more than 5 people in the state of minnesota who know how to drive a car (myself included). i really hate peoeple who think they "use their blinkers" by turning it on halfway through their manuever. DUMBASS! your blinker is to tell people what you are GOING TO DO, not what you are doing. we can clearly already see what you're DOING. people that think that going slower than or at the speed limit makes you a safer driver. if you are an idiot, you are an idiot at any speed, period. i can control a car better at 80mph than any freekin soccer mom can at 30mph. especially because i don't have a backseat with 2 screaming kids. (i do have a backseat in the acura though.) <BR>i guess i just hate the way that the world has gone and gotten itself in a big damn hurry. eveyrone thinks that their getting to where they're going is more important than anyone elses getting to where they need to be. now with e-business and the rat race getting faster (maybe rat race cars need smaller wings and grooved tyres), no one ever stops and looks out their windows. i would say that maybe 7-8% of american drivers actually appreciate driving as an art and a form of entertainment. they look at it as somehting they hate to do and thus all their actions are based on being ornery in the first place.<BR>i'm just glad there are a few people out there like you guys and girls left to make driving worthwhile. i know i'm trying to get the kiddies to understand that when they take drivers ed. i hope i'm doing my part, as i don't think i have a right to complain if i'm not doing anything about it...<BR><P>------------------<BR>allow me to show you my exhaust pipes...||||reg||8
