Z||000063||stsmithgt||03-26-2001||04:56 PM||||I can't beleive it.  Twice in one week, the same mustang blocking me on the freeway at 6:00 in the mourning.  At least he wasn't driving next to me crowding me like last time, but he was pacing the van in front of me so they couldn't get out of my way for about 5 miles.  The van in front of me finally took off and got in front of him.  This guy is a damn moving road block!  He apparently can't drive down the road by himself!  I don't blame it on Mustang owners really.  This guy has no clue that he's creating traffic problems.  It's like he's trying to create a traffic jam when there's only 5 cars on the whole highway. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  I think he goes to the navel post graduate school in town.  He looked military.  If I didn't see that I'm probably older than him, I would have sworn he's in his nineties.(the ol' "OLD MAN IN A HAT" syndrome) I'm only airing out my frustrations, not <I>really</I> road raging. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> *sigh*...That feels better. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||8
